<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('../partials/head') %>
<body>
	<div class="paper-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<%- include('../partials/header') %>

	<main>
		<!-- HERO: Update this copy to change the first impression of the site. -->
    <section id="home" class="hero section-wrap">
		<div class="hero-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> <%= profile.siteName %>'s little corner</p>
			<h1>Welcome to my<br><em>cozy</em> corner<br>of the internet<span class="pink-dot">.</span></h1>
			<p class="hero-intro"><%= profile.heroText %></p>
			<div class="hero-actions">
				<a class="button button-primary" href="#latest">wander through <span>→</span></a>
				<a class="text-link" href="#about">a little about me <span>↗</span></a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<!-- TODO: change to images that go with xojazzle -->
      	<div class="hero-collage" aria-label="A scrapbook collage of books, movies, and coffee">
			<div class="sunburst" aria-hidden="true"></div>
			<span class="sticker sticker-star" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
			<span class="sticker sticker-flower" aria-hidden="true">✽</span>
			<span class="tape tape-hero" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<figure class="polaroid polaroid-main">
				<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512820790803-83ca734da794?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Open book in warm light">
				<figcaption>slow mornings & good stories</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<figure class="polaroid polaroid-small">
				<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1485846234645-a62644f84728?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Cinematic movie theater curtain">
				<figcaption>movie night</figcaption>
			</figure>
			<div class="journal-scrap">
				<span class="journal-date">OCT 03</span>
				<p>today I am<br><strong>choosing joy</strong></p>
				<span class="journal-heart">♡</span>
			</div>
			<span class="doodle doodle-curve" aria-hidden="true">〰</span>
		</div>
    </section>

    <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span><span>♡</span><span>✦</span></div>

    <!-- CURRENTLY LOVING: Replace title, note, image, and rating in either card. -->
    <section id="loving" class="section-wrap loving-section" aria-labelledby="loving-title"><div class="section-heading centered-heading"><p class="eyebrow">from the current chapter</p><h2 id="loving-title">Currently <em>loving</em></h2><p class="section-subtitle">A few things keeping me company lately.</p></div><div class="loving-grid">
      <article class="love-card love-book" id="books"><p class="love-card-label">currently reading <span>♡</span></p><div class="love-content"><div class="book-cover" role="img" aria-label="Decorative placeholder for a book cover"><span>the<br>night<br>circus</span><small>erin morgenstern</small></div><div class="love-note"><span class="hand-label">my note</span><p>“The kind of book that makes you want to live inside its pages.”</p><div class="rating" aria-label="Five out of five stars">★★★★★</div></div></div><span class="tape tape-card" aria-hidden="true"></span></article>
      <article class="love-card love-movie" id="movies"><p class="love-card-label">currently watching <span>✦</span></p><div class="love-content"><div class="movie-poster"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1489599849927-2ee91cede3ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=700&q=85" alt="Rows of seats in a movie theater"><span>midnight<br>cinema</span></div><div class="love-note"><span class="hand-label">movie night</span><p>Old movies, buttery popcorn, and no plans tomorrow.</p><div class="rating">↗ on repeat</div></div></div><span class="sticker sticker-ticket">admit one<br>♡</span></article>
    </div></section>

    <!-- POSTS: Add another article with data-category to extend the filterable grid. -->
    <section id="latest" class="section-wrap latest-section" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
		<div class="section-heading heading-row">
			<div>
				<p class="eyebrow">fresh from the scrapbook</p>
				<h2 id="latest-title">Latest <em>little notes</em></h2>
			</div>
			<div class="filter-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Filter posts by category">
				<button class="filter active" type="button" data-filter="all">all notes</button>
				<button class="filter" type="button" data-filter="books">books</button>
				<button class="filter" type="button" data-filter="movies">movies</button>
				<button class="filter" type="button" data-filter="personal">personal</button>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="posts-grid">
			<% if (latestPosts.length === 0) { %>
				<div class="empty-posts">
				<p class="hand-label">nothing here just yet ♡</p>
				<p>New notes are being tucked into the scrapbook.</p>
				</div>
			<% } else { %>
				<% latestPosts.forEach((post, index) => { %>
				<%- include("../partials/postcard", { post, index }) %>
				<% }) %>
			<% } %>
		</div>
	</section>

    <!-- ANIME + TV: This anchor keeps the existing blog categories represented. -->
    <section id="anime" class="category-note section-wrap" aria-labelledby="category-title"><div class="category-note-copy"><p class="eyebrow">for the comfort-watch people</p><h2 id="category-title">TV shows, anime<br>& <em>everything in between</em></h2><p>From a perfect opening theme to a season finale that emotionally ruins me, this is where I keep the shows I can’t stop talking about.</p><a class="text-link" href="#latest">see the latest watch notes <span>→</span></a></div><div class="category-doodle" aria-hidden="true"><span>✦</span><strong>watch<br>list</strong><span>♡</span></div></section>

    <section id="diary" class="diary-section" aria-labelledby="diary-title"><div class="diary-inner section-wrap"><div class="diary-heading"><span class="stamp">PERSONAL<br>ARCHIVE</span><p class="eyebrow">from my actual diary</p><h2 id="diary-title">A few thoughts<br>from <em>lately</em></h2><p class="diary-intro">The unpolished bits. Tiny observations, half-formed ideas, and reminders to myself.</p><span class="doodle arrow-doodle">↘</span></div><div class="diary-entries"><article class="diary-entry entry-one"><div class="entry-meta"><time datetime="2024-10-03">03.10.24</time><span>thursday</span></div><h3>Letting a day be ordinary.</h3><p>There is so much beauty in a day that doesn’t need to become a story. Today had toast, a long walk, and a very good chapter.</p><span class="entry-scribble">keep this feeling ♡</span></article><article class="diary-entry entry-two"><div class="entry-meta"><time datetime="2024-09-26">26.09.24</time><span>thursday</span></div><h3>Currently: collecting small joys.</h3><p>A yellow leaf on the sidewalk. A song that knows exactly what I mean. The first sip of coffee in a quiet kitchen.</p><span class="entry-scribble">more of this, please ✦</span></article><article class="diary-entry entry-three"><div class="entry-meta"><time datetime="2024-09-14">14.09.24</time><span>saturday</span></div><h3>Notes from a slow morning.</h3><p>I think the secret is not to rush the parts of life that are already lovely.</p><span class="entry-scribble">— me, to me</span></article></div></div></section>

    <section id="about" class="about-section section-wrap" aria-labelledby="about-title">
		<div class="about-photo">
			<span class="tape tape-about" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<img src="<%= profile.profileImageUrl %>" alt="Portrait of <%= profile.siteName %>">
			<span class="photo-caption">hello, I’m XOJazzle ✿</span>
		</div>
		<div class="about-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">a little introduction</p>
			<h2 id="about-title">Hi, I’m XOJazzle.<br>
				<em>Nice to meet you.</em>
			</h2>
			<p><%= profile.aboutContent %></p>
			<p>Pull up a chair, stay awhile, and tell me what you’re loving lately.</p>
			<% if (profile.contactEmail) { %>
				<a
					class="button button-secondary"
					href="mailto:<%= profile.contactEmail %>"
				>
					say hello <span>♡</span>
				</a>
			<% } %>
	</section>
  </main>


	<%- include('../partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>